        "INFOPLIST_KEY_NSBluetoothPeripheralUsageDescription": "WaterLogged uses Bluetooth to connect to your dive computer and import dive logs.",
        "INFOPLIST_KEY_NSContactsUsageDescription": "WaterLogged uses Contacts to import buddy and owner details you select.",
